   720p50/60 use 464.4 Mbps lanes; all other modes use 928.8 Mbps.
   The p1-goggle-1080p profile selects the QY45043A0 stock raster and PHY.
+  The p1-goggle-pro-1080p profile selects the VR04 HD Pro's: CEA 1080p60 on
