 	help
 	  Four-lane 1080p panel used by BETAFPV P1 goggles.
+
+config DRM_PANEL_BETAFPV_VR04_PRO
+	tristate "BETAFPV VR04 HD Pro display (GM8773C bridge and panel)"
+	depends on OF && DRM && I2C
+	select DRM_MIPI_DSI
+	select DRM_PANEL
+	help
+	  The 1080p display of the BETAFPV VR04 HD Pro goggles: a GM8773C
+	  on I2C that takes the SoC's DSI video and sends the panel its init.
