+ * the bridge's own 34 registers (the code at 0xdb0), then the 202 DSI
+ * packets it relays to the panel in low-power mode (the table at .data 0x12058,
+ * 204 entries of 2580 bytes, two of them waits), ending with Sleep-Out and
+ * Display-On.
+ *
+ * Do not hand-edit; regenerate from the library.
